    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TP es un MMORPG 2D F2P orientado al PvP con un combate din\u00e1mico en donde tu habilidad es el principal factor a la hora de obtener la victoria.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>  <br>\u00a1Unite a TP y compet\u00ed con otros jugadores por el dominio de estas tierras!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353150/extras/359fe114de176930d59818ceba616df7.poster.avif?t=1743694067\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353150/extras/359fe114de176930d59818ceba616df7.webm?t=1743694067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353150/extras/359fe114de176930d59818ceba616df7.mp4?t=1743694067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a1Explor\u00e1 el mundo de TP, unite a una faccion, party o clan y combat\u00ed contra otros jugadores y criaturas!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353150/extras/8161060331a25a97dc92388bf9f99827.poster.avif?t=1743694067\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353150/extras/8161060331a25a97dc92388bf9f99827.webm?t=1743694067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353150/extras/8161060331a25a97dc92388bf9f99827.mp4?t=1743694067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a1Particip\u00e1 en eventos masivos con otros jugadores!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353150/extras/3d6cceb2eb697e1d7f565a32d164e44c.poster.avif?t=1743694067\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353150/extras/3d6cceb2eb697e1d7f565a32d164e44c.webm?t=1743694067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353150/extras/3d6cceb2eb697e1d7f565a32d164e44c.mp4?t=1743694067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a1Compet\u00ed en nuestro sistema de matchmaking para medir tu habilidad contra otros jugadores!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353150/extras/da5b64f1d50bbd4435477770e6d14463.poster.avif?t=1743694067\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353150/extras/da5b64f1d50bbd4435477770e6d14463.webm?t=1743694067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353150/extras/da5b64f1d50bbd4435477770e6d14463.mp4?t=1743694067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a1Crea un lobby de Coliseo y luch\u00e1 en batallas individuales o en grupo de hasta 5vs5!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353150/extras/5e65aa8a1833dc3281e6b66d2eb7d9f9.poster.avif?t=1743694067\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353150/extras/5e65aa8a1833dc3281e6b66d2eb7d9f9.webm?t=1743694067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353150/extras/5e65aa8a1833dc3281e6b66d2eb7d9f9.mp4?t=1743694067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a1Consegu\u00ed distintos materiales para craftear y mejorar tu equipamiento!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353150/extras/84a77634ab590cb2fd13a2025f17127f.poster.avif?t=1743694067\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353150/extras/84a77634ab590cb2fd13a2025f17127f.webm?t=1743694067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353150/extras/84a77634ab590cb2fd13a2025f17127f.mp4?t=1743694067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a1Consegu\u00ed una montura y entrena una pet para que te ayuden en el combate!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353150/extras/bc0b3ea37497a8e1557ce8f6f017f89b.poster.avif?t=1743694067\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353150/extras/bc0b3ea37497a8e1557ce8f6f017f89b.webm?t=1743694067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353150/extras/bc0b3ea37497a8e1557ce8f6f017f89b.mp4?t=1743694067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Caracteristicas</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Multiplataforma, disponible en PC y Android en Google Play.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Comunidad activa de Discord con 5.000 miembros.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>3 Facciones a las que te podes unir: Orden de Amperlux, Legion de Karmaggar o Mercenarios de Aztaris.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Creaci\u00f3n de clanes, conquistas de castillos y enfrentamientos clan vs clan en el coliseo.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Misiones individuales y grupales de hasta 5 jugadores.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mas de 100 pets diferentes para entrenar y ense\u00f1arle distintas habilidades de combate.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Coliseos para duelos de 1v1 hasta 5v5.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Matchmaking competitivo con rankings y t\u00edtulos.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Intenta sobrevivir el mayor numero de rondas contra otros jugadores en el sistema de desafio.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Eventos diarios PvP masivos como Guerra Faccionaria, Rey de la Colina, Captura la Bandera, Caceria de Joyas y Deathmatch.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Crafteo, mejora y customizacion de equipamiento.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mercado de compra y venta de objetos y personajes.</i></p></li></ul>",
